abstract: >
  HERESY v6.0.0 AI/1440 is a dependency-free deterministic evidence and model-governance
  appliance that compacts exported WHOAMI-18437 Report Card Gauntlet receipts into a
  standard 1,474,560-byte FAT12 floppy image. It includes SHA-256 provenance, deterministic
  sparse retrieval, HERETIC-0 as a zero-parameter non-neural epistemic and mathematics
  control, PARENT-0 as a deterministic concerned-parent expert system, and an optional
  host-side local Ollama lecture harness that records visible responses into a human-readable
  LECTURE.md and machine-readable JSON receipt. The boot sector contains genuine 16-bit x86
  code. The production appliance has no hosted inference, runtime dependency, telemetry or
  network requirement.
